GrandPerspective*/

# App Store marketing material — screenshots, artboards, and the listing copy.
# Deliberately not in the repo: nothing in the build reads any of it, it is
# ~11 MB of PNG against a sub-1 MB source tree, and this repo is public and
# cloned to build. It lives with the Photoshop sources it is exported from:
#
#   Google Drive (sam@flymedia.us) → My Drive/Apps/AppleTree/App Store/
#     EXPORT/                 the artboards uploaded to App Store Connect
#     AppStoreListing.md      name, subtitle, keywords, description, review notes
#     Screenshots/            raw captures the artboards are built from
#
AppStoreScreenshots/
AppStoreListing.md
